<title>UK: Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 43 cargoes in Nov.</title>
<headline>Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 43 cargoes in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude liftings in November are scheduled to total the equivalent of 43 standard 500,000-barrel cargoes, compared with 43.2 in the original October programme, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>November loadings should total 21.5 million barrels, compared with 21.63 million in October.  </p>
<p>Traders expect the November programme to be made up of 21 cargoes of 500,000 barrels, 15 of 600,000 barrels and two of one million barrels.</p>
<p>-- Mark Thompson, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
